         <change when="2025-11-19T20:25:35-05:00" who="http://papyri.info/editor/users/costasbala">Commit - I have integrated BL 9 together with P.Oxy. 55 3781 for lin1 and BL 7 for lin7 Αἰμίλιον =&gt; Ἀκύλιον. In lin4 the difficult Σ̣ερήφεως =&gt; Ἑ̣ρήσεως (for the village, see Benaissa, Rural Settlements of the Oxy. Nome pp. 72-73). In lin10, α.1ίῳ =&gt; ἀξιῶ (perhaps preceded by καὶ, but the text is damaged). In lin16, N. Litinas has convincingly read ἐπ̣ι̣δ̣έδωκα ὡς π[ρόκειται.?], and, therefore, τῆς Ὠασεως .4ρ̣[.?] should be dismissed. </change>
